        "content": "{\"error_code\":\"STL-208\",\"incident_id\":\"INC-0987\",\"not_related_to\":\"issuer routing or authorization decline handling\",\"opened_at\":\"2026-05-12T03:40:00Z\",\"resolution\":\"Deduplicated by acquirer reference and added a unique constraint. The worker now upserts on the reference key.\",\"resolved_at\":\"2026-05-12T09:15:00Z\",\"root_cause\":\"The reconciliation worker used a non-idempotent insert keyed on a timestamp rather than the acquirer chargeback reference.\",\"route\":\"Settlement Engineering\",\"service\":\"settlement-worker\",\"severity\":\"medium\",\"summary\":\"A reconciliation job retried after a partial write and created duplicate chargeback rows for 1,412 synthetic transactions. Merchant balances were overstated for six hours.\",\"tenant\":\"HelioPay (fictional)\",\"title\":\"Duplicate chargeback records after reconciliation retry\"}",
